<sect2 id="gimp-path-fill">
  <title>Fill Paths</title>

  <indexterm>
    <primary>Fill Paths</primary>
  </indexterm>

  <para>
    This function fills all areas delimited by the selected paths.
  </para>
  <para>
    This command is only enabled when at least one path is selected.
  </para>

  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o comando</title>
    <para>
      You can access this command from the main menu through
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Edit</guimenu>
        <guimenuitem>Fill Paths…</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>

  <sect3>
    <title>Opções</title>
    <para>Esse comando faz aparecer uma janela de diálogo:</para>
    <figure>
      <title>A janela de diálogo <quote>Escolher estilo de preenchimento</quote></title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/menus/edit/fill-selection-outline.png"/>
        </imageobject>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
    <variablelist>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Foreground color</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>A cor de frente da caixa de ferramentas é usada.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Background color</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            The background color of the toolbox is used.
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Textura</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>A textura ativa da caixa de ferramentas é usada.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Anti-serrilhamento</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>Esta opção fica marcada por padrão.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
    </variablelist>
    <figure>
      <title>Fill Paths Example</title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/menus/edit/fill-path-ex1.png"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>Antes do preenchimento</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata format="PNG" fileref="images/menus/edit/fill-path-ex2.png"/>
        </imageobject>
        <caption>
          <para>Depois do preenchimento</para>
        </caption>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
  </sect3>
</sect2>
